 (deep):** a non-vanishing restricted obstruction forces\nblowup. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionTowerContext.is_NS_singular","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionTowerContext.is_NS_singular","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/ns_obstruction_tower.lean#L33-L33","doc":"Predicate: the QOU is NS-singular (blowup occurs). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionTowerContext.res_sigma","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionTowerContext.res_sigma","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/ns_obstruction_tower.lean#L31-L31","doc":"Restriction `res_Σ(κ_n)` of `κ_n` to the collision locus `Σ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionTowerContext.kappa","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionTowerContext.kappa","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/ns_obstruction_tower.lean#L29-L29","doc":"Yekutieli obstruction classes `κ_n` indexed by `n : ℕ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionTowerContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionTowerContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/ns_obstruction_tower.lean#L27-L27","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionTowerContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionTowerContext","kind":"class","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.